  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: adad512837bf8774ab6812d9fd0f6086, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1036262531072
    m_Localized: Back to Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036275113984
    m_Localized: It has become fashionable amongst the people to strive to live simpler
      lives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036275113985
    m_Localized: Bountiful Tides
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036275113986
    m_Localized: Unusually rich currents bring fish closer to shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308288
    m_Localized: Contageous Laziness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308289
    m_Localized: Peoples lives are becoming easy. Maybe a little too easy. Nobody
      wants to work hard anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308290
    m_Localized: Crafty Snobs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308291
    m_Localized: The rich elite is becoming unusually crafty. Perhaps a new trend
      to pass the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308292
    m_Localized: Dry Winds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308293
    m_Localized: Bad weather ruins much of the seasonal crops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308294
    m_Localized: Generous Nobles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308295
    m_Localized: The nobility around these parts are in a giving mood and support
      all towns in their development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308296
    m_Localized: Heavy Rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308297
    m_Localized: The clouds are dark, the air is thick. This storm isn't going to
      end any time soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308298
    m_Localized: Horse Shortage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308299
    m_Localized: People need to ride and they take what they can get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308300
    m_Localized: Land Slides
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308301
    m_Localized: Large parts of the mountains have become impassable making the mines
      hardly usable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308302
    m_Localized: Market Fair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308303
    m_Localized: A regional fair attracts traders and travelers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308304
    m_Localized: Panic Purchases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308305
    m_Localized: 'Rumors of a coming plague are spreading. Panic sets in, and the
      people know their priorities: anything remotely suitable for wiping one''s
      behinds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308306
    m_Localized: Golden Times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308307
    m_Localized: Things have been great these past few years. The pepole are happy
      and healthy and life is good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308308
    m_Localized: Plentiful Oceans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308309
    m_Localized: The oceans are plentiful here. Sadly, that's about the only thing
      plentiful. Everything else is expensvie and hard to get. So, towns really want
      to get some briny, juicy ocean stuff!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308310
    m_Localized: Non-Ocean towns only request Ocean goods in their missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308311
    m_Localized: Times of Mistrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308312
    m_Localized: People in this area like to stick to themselves and don't trust
      the others. You start with towns of one region on your side and will need to
      play your cards right to please everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308313
    m_Localized: '{0} development change rate'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308314
    m_Localized: '{0} caravan movement speed'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308315
    m_Localized: '{0} to prices {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308316
    m_Localized: '{0} to purchase prices {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308317
    m_Localized: '{0} to sale prices {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308318
    m_Localized: '{0} production speed {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308319
    m_Localized: '{0} for all reputation changes'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308320
    m_Localized: Your allies will start the game with a high reputation of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308321
    m_Localized: This town is your ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1036279308322
    m_Localized: This town is your foe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 357294081531904
    m_Localized: Ongoing Events
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 366830397906944
    m_Localized: 'Event started: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 366897418690560
    m_Localized: 'Event expired: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1843393402068992
    m_Localized: Helping Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1843739910299648
    m_Localized: Welcome to the game! We made things easy for you to get acquainted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
